# 10. Bind the receipt into the attestation

The crucial trick is `report_data`.

dstack allows up to 64 bytes of application-controlled data in quote/attestation evidence. ([GitHub][7])

Don't merely attest:

```text
"I am Moltwork container X"
```

Attest:

```text
"I am Moltwork container X,
and this exact workload produced receipt R
for fresh verifier challenge N."
```

For example:

```text
receiptDigest = keccak256(receipt)
challengeHash = keccak256(verifierNonce)

reportData =
    receiptDigest      32 bytes
    ||
    challengeHash      32 bytes
```

Exactly 64 bytes.

Now the attestation is bound to:

```text
code identity
+
current run receipt
+
fresh verifier request
```

This kills a huge class of replay bullshit.

